    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this well-maintained three-bedroom semi-detached home in the popular residential development of Aspen Drive, Kinsealy. The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious front living room with feature fireplace, modern fitted kitchen and bright dining area with sliding doors opening onto the rear garden. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom. The property also benefits from a detached garden room to the rear offering excellent flexibility as a home office, studio or additional living space.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located in Kinsealy, with a wide range of amenities close by. Local shops and services are available nearby, while the Pavilions Shopping Centre in Swords offers an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. Malahide and Swords are both within easy reach, with Malahide Castle, the marina and coastline providing further recreational amenities. The property also benefits from excellent access to Dublin Airport, the M1 and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer - 1.72m (5'8\") x 3.59m (11'9\")\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with laminate timber flooring, glazed front door with side panels, understairs storage and access to the main reception and kitchen. Freshly painted in neutral tones.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.87m (12'8\") x 4.36m (14'4\")\r\nSpacious front reception with bay window, feature fireplace, laminate wood flooring and decorative ceiling rose. Double doors lead through to the rear living space, creating an ideal entertaining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.13m (7'0\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\r\nModern fitted kitchen with ample cream units, tiled splash-backs, integrated oven and hob, space for appliances and tiled floor. Positioned to the rear with window overlooking the patio garden.\r\n\r\nDining Area - 3.08m (10'1\") x 4.08m (13'5\")\r\nBright open-plan dining space off the kitchen with large sliding doors opening directly to the paved rear garden, ideal for indoor-outdoor living and family gatherings.\r\n\r\nHall - 1.72m (5'8\") x 2.72m (8'11\")\r\nFirst-floor landing with white balustrade, window providing natural light and access to three bedrooms and the main bathroom. Neutral décor and carpeted floor.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.39m (11'1\") x 3.56m (11'8\")\r\nGenerous double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, with wood-effect flooring, large window and ample space for wardrobes. Light, modern colour palette.\r\n\r\nBedroom - 3.39m (11'1\") x 3.56m (11'8\")\r\nFront-facing double bedroom with wood-effect flooring, radiator under window and space for storage. Bright and easily styled as a guest or children`s room.\r\n\r\nBedroom - 2.36m (7'9\") x 2.45m (8'0\")\r\nThird bedroom to the front, ideal as a single room, nursery or home office. Features wood-effect flooring and a wide window providing plenty of light.\r\n\r\nBath - 2.06m (6'9\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\r\nContemporary shower room with full-height neutral tiling, corner shower enclosure, WC, wash hand basin and frosted window. Finished to a high modern standard.\r\n\r\nGarden Room\r\nDetached garden room at the rear with a seating area. Offers potential as a home office or studio, opening onto the fully paved, low-maintenance garden.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private driveway and landscaped front garden, while to the rear is a fully paved, low-maintenance garden with a detached garden room, providing an ideal additional space for a home office, studio or relaxation area.\r\n\r\nTotal floor area: 81 Sq. M - 874 Sq.Ft \r\n\r\nExternally: There is parking to the front via. a driveway, lawn space to the side and side access. The rear garden is private with a paved patio, side gate access and a timber storage shed with power supply."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Chain free sale\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nGas central heating - New boiler\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac\r\nStorage shed\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nRecently renovated bathroom\r\nOpen-plan kitchen dining\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nLow-maintenance rear garden\r\nFresh neutral interiors\r\nClose to local amenities\r\nQuiet location close to shops and parks"
      },
